B.aF6=new A.fh("Quantum Mean Filter","As an **Intern** in Quantum Software Development at **Classiq**, I collaborated with my team to develop and implement a **Quantum Mean Filter** for **Quantum Signal Processing**. This project utilized advanced quantum techniques such as **NEQR (Novel Enhanced Quantum Representation), ENEQR (Extended NEQR), Cyclic Shift, Quantum Full Adder, and Quantum Multiplier** to implement algorithm, processing efficiency, and filtering accuracy.","Classiq","Remote Intern",u.y)
B.aF7=new A.fh("Quantum Key Distribution -BB84 PROTOCOLS","As part of my **Capstone Project** for **QubitXQubits 2024**, I developed a simulation of the **BB84 quantum key distribution** protocol, focusing on secure quantum communication. The project included **Eve's attack** simulations, implementing **Intercept-and-Send** and **Entangle-Qubit Attack** functions to analyze potential security breaches. Additionally, I explored a **quantum entanglement-based** approach to enhance security, demonstrating how entanglement can improve key distribution integrity against **eavesdropping** attempts.","Cirq","Capstone Project","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/BB84-Quantum-Key-Distribution")
B.aF5=new A.fh("Grover's Search Algorithm for MultiState","Implemented an extended version of **Grover's Search Algorithm** designed specifically for **multi-state quantum systems**. Unlike the standard binary Grover's algorithm which identifies a single marked item in an unstructured database, this implementation generalized this approach to efficiently search for **multiple target states**  by refining the oracle and diffusion operators, I optimized amplitude amplification.","Cirq","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/GroverSearch-ENEQR/blob/main/GroverSearchForMultiState.ipynb")
B.aEW=new A.fh("Young's Double Slit Experiment","As a personal endeavor, I leveraged the probabilistic nature of qubits to simulate **Young\u2019s Double-Slit Experiment** using **Qiskit**. This project explored quantum **superposition and interference** principles, demonstrating how quantum computing can model classical **wave-particle duality**. The implementation utilized **quantum circuits** to mimic photon behavior","Python , Qiskit, Qiskit-AER","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/Young-s-Double-Slit-Experiment")
B.aEX=new A.fh("ENEQR(Extended NEQR)","Implemented the **ENEQR algorithm**, integrating dynamic circuit techniques which involved converting odd values to even using controlled operations and CNOT gate","CIRQ","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/GroverSearch-ENEQR/blob/main/OddToEven.ipynb")
