B.aI0=new A.z2("ATS based Kerr-Cat Qubit","Participated in the research, design and development of **Asymmetrically Threaded SQUIDs (ATS)**-based Superconducting Kerr Cat Qubits. As a Sub-Team Lead, of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, Q3D, and KQLayout** for quantum circuit development. Under the supervision of **Dr. Shantanu Jha https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=CKj1TYUAAAAJ&hl=en&authuser=3** and **Mr. Muhammad Waqar Amin https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Muhammad-Waqar-Amin**. ",u.E,B.atW,null)
B.aI_=new A.z2("Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium","Participated in the research, design and development of **Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium (FTF)**-based Superconducting Qubits.With implementation of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, KQLayout, and QuTip** for quantum circuit development. My work focused on optimizing circuit parameters to enhance coherence and gate performance, contributing to advancements in superconducting qubit architectures.",u.E,B.cS,null)
B.awA=s(["Dr. Gal Winer https://scholar.google.co.il/citations?user=LiMlypIAAAAJ&hl=en"],t.s)
B.aHZ=new A.z2("Quantum Mean Filter","As an **Intern** in Quantum Software Development at **Classiq**,under the supervision of **Dr. Gal Winer https://scholar.google.co.il/citations?user=LiMlypIAAAAJ&hl=en**. I collaborated with my team to develop and implement a **Quantum Mean Filter** for **Quantum Signal Processing**. This project utilized advanced quantum techniques such as **NEQR (Novel Enhanced Quantum Representation), ENEQR (Extended NEQR), Cyclic Shift, Quantum Full Adder, and Quantum Multiplier** to implement algorithm, processing efficiency, and filtering accuracy.","Classiq",B.awA,u.y)
B.ax_=s([B.aI0,B.aI_,B.aHZ],A.a5("r<z2>"))
B.aEY=new A.fh("Audio Editor(Trimmer, Merger)","As the developer of the **Audio Editor**, I built a comprehensive **Trimmer** and **Merger** system from scratch as a part for my **Undergrad Major Project**, focusing on the FrontEnd implementation. I successfully integrated **FFmpeg** for advanced audio manipulation capabilities including **trimming**, **merging**, and **extracting audio from video files**. The project was designed with the aim of developing an **open-source package** to be published on **pub.dev** for wider community use.","Flutter, ffmpeg","Personal Endeavor, Developer","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Hl3wFiGG7A8mf5cZshCe_mTiz_hoa7gY/view?usp=sharing")
B.aF_=new A.fh("ASKME.COM","ASKME.COM is an Udemy-style app featuring course booking, real-time doubt resolution, and seamless learning. It integrates **eSewa** for secure transactions, **WebSocket** for instant messaging, and **WebRTC** for high-quality voice/video calls, **Nudity** and **Profanity Filter**. The platform ensures smooth interaction between learners and instructors, enhancing the overall educational experience.","ESewa, WebRtc, WebSocket, Dio, Hive, tfLite","Flutter Tech Lead","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.askme.com")
B.aF1=new A.fh("Kaha Mobile","As a part-time Senior Developer at Masovision Technology (P) Ltd., I worked with the team on Kaha Mobile. I contributed to implementing **interceptors, Clean Architecture, Google Maps, and Google API integration**, ensuring a scalable and efficient application structure.","Google Maps, Google API","Senior Flutter Developer","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.kaha_hits.kaha&hl=en")
B.aEV=new A.fh("Geohash Locator","Implemented **dynamic map** interface enabling users to **navigate and explore** locations seamlessly. This project incorporates **real-time location tracking**, allowing users to **pinpoint their position** on the map. Additionally, it supports **custom markers to highlight specific points** of interest. To ensure efficient data storage and retrieval, the system is integrated with **Firebase**, providing a robust backend for managing **location-related** information.","Flutter Map, GeoHash, Firebase, Color Picker","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/GeoHash")
B.aEZ=new A.fh("Bhagavat Gita","As a personal endeavor, I developed a Bhagavad Gita mobile application with a focus on seamless offline access. The app follows an **Offline-First** approach, ensuring users can read without an internet connection. I implemented **DIO** Interceptors for efficient API handling, integrated **Text-to-Speech** for an immersive listening experience, and added a **Last Read Notifier** to help users resume from where they left off","Text To Speech,Dio, Hive, RiverPod ","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/Bhagavat-Gita")
B.aF4=new A.fh("Wordle",'As part of my personal endeavor, I conceptualized and developed a mobile application inspired by the popular web-based game "Wordle." This project involved building the game from scratch, adapting its mechanics. The implementation focused on intuitive gameplay, responsive design, and an engaging user interface to bring the classic word-guessing challenge to mobile users.',"Flutter, C/C++","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/Wordle_with_flutter")
B.axe=s([B.aEY,B.aF_,B.aF1,B.aEV,B.aEZ,B.aF4],t.th)
B.axh=s(["Ah yes, this website. Absolutely stunning on PC \u2014 truly a masterpiece.","On mobile though? Let's just say I 'ran out of motivation' is doing a lot of heavy lifting.","Honestly, it's a bit like quantum superposition \u2014 on mobile, I both exist and don't. Schr\xf6dinger would be thrilled.","But open this on PC, and congrats, you've collapsed the wave function. You measured me, so now I exist. You're welcome, Risav Pokhrel is officially real.","Want the full experience? Cute. Grab a PC, because mobile users just get unresolved quantum uncertainty."],t.s)
